                            <comment id="19440370" author="JIRAUSER129848" created="Thu, 23 Apr 2026 21:40:06 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ASaha67&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ASaha67&quot;&gt;Saha, Ankita [JJCUS NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; Issue was corrected and deployed to TEST, assigning back.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19410062" author="JIRAUSER182813" created="Tue, 21 Apr 2026 15:32:32 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=CSims11&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;CSims11&quot;&gt;Sims, Cody [JRDUS]&lt;/a&gt; - As per AC below the Balance Data is not showing in correct format for Residual Difference &amp;amp; Difference weighing methods. In Balance Data column it only shows the Actual Amount&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos;Difference&apos; -&amp;gt; &#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;Actual Amount (Total Amt (Pan + Sample) minus Tare(Pan))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos; Residual Difference&apos; -&amp;gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;Actual Amount ((Pan + Sample) minus&#160; (Pan + Residual))&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/6780732/6780732_image-2026-04-21-09-32-02-835.png&quot; height=&quot;313&quot; width=&quot;634&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19021630" author="JIRAUSER124482" created="Mon, 9 Mar 2026 12:44:14 +0100"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=WVermeu4&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;WVermeu4&quot;&gt;Vermeulen, Wim [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; Could you please modify the below in AC to match the values in Balance Data field?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Weighing Measurements:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos;Direct&apos; -&amp;gt;&#160; Actual Amount&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos;Difference&apos; -&amp;gt; &#160;Actual Amount (Total Amt (Pan + Sample) minus Tare(Pan))&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos; Residual Difference&apos; -&amp;gt;Actual Amount ((Pan + Sample) minus&#160; (Pan + Residual))&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
