                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A Signals Experiment with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;one or more hub-connected balances in the Equipment Table (Equipment Class = Balance)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Table Template Preparation Sub (with external action)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has added one or more internal references to items from &apos;GxP CISPro Materials&apos;, &apos;GxP Biovia Samples&apos; or &apos;GxP Preparations&apos; in the Preparations sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User is in the Balance Interface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; the User pulls balance weighing measurements in the Balance interface and closes the Interface&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#172b4d&quot;&gt;Then&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the User shall notice that the System has auto-populated the following metadata in property &apos;Balance Data&apos; of the Preparations Sub table (separated by pipelines in order below):
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Equipment ID of Balance used for measurement.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;(Nick)name of Balance used for measurement. Note If Empty = &apos;UNKNOWN&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Weighing method used during measurement&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Weighing Measurements:
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos;Direct&apos; -&amp;gt;&#160; Actual Amount&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos;Difference&apos; -&amp;gt; &#160;Actual Amount (Total Amt (Pan + Sample) minus Tare(Pan))&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;If Weighing Methods = &apos; Residual Difference&apos; -&amp;gt;Actual Amount ((Pan + Sample) minus&#160; (Pan + Residual))&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&apos;CAL DUE:&apos; Calibration Due Date/Time of selected balance.
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: If no Calibration Event in Biovia &apos;CAL DUE: UNDEFINED&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&apos;VER DUE:&apos; Verification Due Date/Time of selected balance
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: If no Calibration Event in Biovia &apos;VER DUE: UNDEFINED&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Status of Balance. Note If Empty = &apos;UNKNOWN&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State of Balance.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;GxP Level of Balance&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&apos;LL:&apos; Lower Operating Limit of Balance - Note: if empty = &apos;UNKNOWN&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;&apos;UL:&apos; Upper Operating Limit of Balance - Note: if empty = &apos;UNKNOWN&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;J&amp;amp;J Username (e.g. WVERMEU4)
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Note: J&amp;amp;J User Name can be retrieved from the User&apos;s email address (Users), but remove everything starting from the @ symbol (including the @ itself).&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Current Data/Time Stamp expressed in UTC +/- offset&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the User shall notice that the System has auto-populated the &apos;Fit for GxP&apos; property according to following business rules&#160;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;value for Fit for GxP = &apos;YES&apos; When&#160;
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;GxP Level = &apos;GMP&apos; and&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Calibration Due Date/Time &amp;gt; or = Date(NOW) and&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Verification Due Date/Time &amp;gt; or = Date(NOW) and&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State = &apos;Active&apos; and&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Status = &apos;Active&apos; and&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Actual Amt &amp;gt; Lower Operating Limit AND Actual Amt &amp;lt; Upper Operating Limit&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;value for Fit for GxP = &apos;NO&apos; when&#160;
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;GxP Level = &apos;Non-GMP&apos; or&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Calibration Due Date/Time &amp;lt; Date/Time(NOW) or &apos;UNDEFINED&apos; or&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Verification Due Date/Time &amp;lt; Date/Time(NOW) or &apos;UNDEFINED&apos; or&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Life Cycle State is any other value than &apos;Active&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Status is any other value than &apos;Active&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Actual Amt &amp;lt; Lower Operating Limit OR Actual Amt &amp;gt; Upper Operating Limit&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
